{"id":"H0302","lemma":"אֲחִיתֹ֫פֶל","transliteration":"achitophel","sayIt":"a-chi-TO-phel","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahithophel","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.15.12;\nfather of: Eliam (H0463H)\n§ Ahithophel = \"my brother is foolish (folly)\"\na counsellor of David, grandfather of Bathsheba (cf 2Sa 11:3, 23:34), who joined Absalom in revolt against David, and committed suicide when Absalom did not heed his counsel","glosses":["ahithophel","among","ahithophel for","ahithophel was","furthermore","when ahithophel"],"count":17,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"for Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"is among","kjv":"Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel for","kjv":"of Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ahithophel was","kjv":"and Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"to Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"And Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ahithophel","kjv":"of Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Furthermore","kjv":"Moreover Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ahithophel","kjv":"that Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ahithophel","kjv":"of Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"Thus and thus did Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"for thus hath Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Ahithophel","kjv":"And when Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-23","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ahithophel","kjv":"of Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-27","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"And Ahithophel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-27","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahithophel","kjv":"Ahithophel"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 15:12","note":"Absalom sent for Ahithophel the Gilonite, David’s counselor, from his city, even from Giloh, while he was offering the sacrifices. The conspiracy was strong…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 27:33","note":"Ahithophel was the king’s counselor. Hushai the Archite was the king’s friend.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0463","lemma":"אֱלִיעָם","transliteration":"eliam","gloss":"Eliam"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}